{% doc %}
  @prompt
    IMPORTANT:
    - Do NOT include the human/person shown in the reference image.
    - The section should be designed specifically for a plant nursery / plant e-commerce website.
    - All plant/product images must be selectable through Shopify's Theme Editor using image upload/picker options.
    - Do NOT hardcode image URLs.
    - Make the section fully responsive for desktop, tablet and mobile.
    
    SECTION LAYOUT:
    
    1. MAIN SECTION
    - Full-width horizontal section.
    - Use a soft warm cream/off-white background.
    - Add a subtle decorative abstract radial/sunburst shape in the background on the right side.
    - Keep the overall design clean, premium and modern.
    - Rounded corners where appropriate.
    
    2. PRODUCT CAROUSEL
    Create a horizontally scrollable product carousel on the left/middle area.
    
    Display 3 plant product cards at a time on desktop.
    
    Each product card should contain:
    
    TOP AREA:
    - Large product image.
    - Image must be selectable/uploadable from Shopify Theme Editor.
    - Image should automatically fit inside the image area without distortion.
    - Rounded top corners.
    - Bestseller badge at top-left.
    - Discount badge at top-right.
    
    PRODUCT DETAILS:
    - Small rating badge such as:
      ★ 4.8 | 440
    - Product title.
    - Short product description.
    - Current price.
    - Original price with strikethrough.
    - Discount percentage.
    - Circular dark-green Add to Cart icon/button at bottom-right.
    
    Example content:
    Product 1:
    Title: Peace Lily Plant
    Description: Stunning air-purifying plant
    Price: ₹299
    Original Price: ₹350
    Discount: 15% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 440
    
    Product 2:
    Title: Anthurium Red Plant
    Description: Long-lasting indoor plant
    Price: ₹699
    Original Price: ₹800
    Discount: 13% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 111
    
    Product 3:
    Title: Jade Mini Plant
    Description: Easy-care lucky succulent
    Price: ₹249
    Original Price: ₹300
    Discount: 17% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 414
    
    3. SHOPIFY CUSTOMIZATION OPTIONS
    
    In the Shopify Theme Editor, provide settings for each product card:
    
    - Product image upload/picker
    - Product title
    - Product description
    - Current price
    - Original price
    - Discount text
    - Bestseller badge ON/OFF
    - Bestseller text
    - Rating
    - Review count
    - Product link
    - Add to cart button
    - Card background color
    
    Allow at least 6 product cards to be added dynamically using Shopify blocks.
    
    Each block should have its own image picker.
    
    4. CAROUSEL FUNCTIONALITY
    
    - Desktop: show 3 cards.
    - Tablet: show 2 cards.
    - Mobile: show 1 card with part of the next card visible.
    - Add a circular dark-green right arrow button overlapping the carousel.
    - Add a left arrow as well, but keep it subtle.
    - Smooth horizontal sliding animation.
    - Touch/swipe support on mobile.
    - Do not use external carousel libraries.
    - Use lightweight JavaScript/CSS.
    - Infinite or smooth looping is preferred.
    - Disable arrows when there are no more slides if infinite looping is not used.
    
    5. DESIGN STYLE
    
    Use a premium nursery / botanical visual style.
    
    Colors:
    - Dark green: #1F5130
    - Yellow/golden accent: #FFD60A
    - Cream background: #FFF9E8
    - White product card: #FFFFFF
    - Muted gray for secondary text.
    
    Typography:
    - Product titles should have a slightly elegant serif style.
    - Descriptions and prices should use a clean modern sans-serif font.
    - Use responsive font sizes.
    
    6. IMAGE SETTINGS
    
    VERY IMPORTANT:
    Every product card must have a Shopify image picker.
    
    Example schema structure:
    
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "product_image",
      "label": "Plant Image"
    }
    
    The uploaded image should be displayed dynamically.
    
    Also provide an optional image picker for:
    - Background/decorative plant image
    - Optional promotional image
    
    Do NOT use the human image from the reference.
    
    7. HOVER EFFECT
    
    When the user hovers over a product card:
    - Slightly lift the card.
    - Add a subtle shadow.
    - Plant image should have a very subtle zoom effect.
    - Add-to-cart button can slightly scale.
    - Keep the animation smooth and premium.
    - Do not make the animation excessive.
    
    8. ADD TO CART
    
    The circular shopping-bag/cart button should work with Shopify's cart functionality.
    
    If the block is connected to a Shopify product:
    - Clicking the button should add the selected product to cart.
    - Use Shopify's product/variant information.
    - If necessary, provide a product selector in the Theme Editor.
    
    Provide:
    - Product selector
    - Variant support
    - Add-to-cart functionality
    
    9. RESPONSIVE DESIGN
    
    Desktop:
    - 3 product cards visible.
    - Cards should have equal width.
    - Carousel occupies approximately 65–70% of the section.
    - Leave enough breathing space around the cards.
    
    Mobile:
    - One card visible at a time.
    - Horizontal swipe carousel.
    - Product cards should remain visually large.
    - Hide unnecessary decorative elements.
    - Keep prices and buttons easy to tap.
    - No horizontal page overflow.
    
    10. CODE REQUIREMENTS
    
    Generate a complete Shopify Online Store 2.0 section.
    
    Provide:
    - Liquid
    - HTML
    - CSS
    - JavaScript
    - Shopify schema
    
    The code must be placed in ONE Shopify section file.
    with view all products button and with link , i want in the image as cart icon button and view all products button with links , in the plant images i want cart icon button and view all products button with hovers
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;background:#fff9e8;padding:32px 20px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{max-width:1200px;margin:auto}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:20px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title{font:clamp(26px,4vw,40px) Georgia,serif;color:#1f5130;margin:0}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__all{padding:12px 20px;border:1px solid #1f5130;border-radius:99px;color:#1f5130;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;transition:.2s}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__all:hover{background:#1f5130;color:white;transform:translateY(-2px)}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{display:flex;gap:18px;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;scroll-behavior:smooth}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex:0 0 calc((100% - 36px)/3);background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px #1f51301a;transition:transform .25s,box-shadow .25s;scroll-snap-align:start}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 12px 26px #1f513033}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image{height:270px;position:relative;background:#f3f0e7}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .3s}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover img{transform:scale(1.035)}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image svg{width:100%;height:100%}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart{position:absolute;right:14px;bottom:14px;width:50px;height:50px;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:#1f5130;color:white;display:grid;place-items:center;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .2s,background .2s;box-shadow:0 3px 12px #0003}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart:hover{background:#0d3a1d;transform:scale(1.1)}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart:focus-visible,.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__all:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ffd60a;outline-offset:3px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__body{padding:14px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-title{font:21px Georgia,serif;color:#1f5130;margin:0 0 6px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price{color:#14231a;font-weight:700}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrows{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px;margin-top:16px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid #1f5130;background:#fff;color:#1f5130;cursor:pointer}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--next{background:#1f5130;color:#fff}@media(max-width:900px){.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex-basis:calc((100% - 18px)/2)}}@media(max-width:600px){.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex-basis:84%}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head{align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;flex-direction:column}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image{height:250px}}{% endstyle %}
<plant-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner"><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head"><h2 class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>{% if block.settings.view_all_link != blank %}<a class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__all" href="{{ block.settings.view_all_link }}">{{ block.settings.view_all_label | escape }}</a>{% endif %}</div><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track" data-track>{% for i in (1..6) %}{% liquid
assign image_key='image_' | append:i
assign product_key='product_' | append:i
assign title_key='title_' | append:i
assign image=block.settings[image_key]
assign product=block.settings[product_key]
assign title=block.settings[title_key]
if product != blank
assign title=product.title
endif
%}{% if image != blank or product != blank or title != blank %}<article class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card"><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image">{% if image %}<img src="{{ image | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="{{ image.alt | default:title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ image.width }}" height="{{ image.height }}">{% elsif product.featured_image %}<img src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | escape }}" loading="lazy">{% else %}{{ 'product-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}{% endif %}{% if product != blank %}<form method="post" action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}"><input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1"><button class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart" aria-label="Add {{ product.title | escape }} to cart" type="submit"><svg width="23" height="23" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 8h14l1 13H4L5 8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M9 9V6a3 3 0 0 1 6 0v3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg></button></form>{% else %}<a class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart" href="{{ block.settings.view_all_link }}" aria-label="Browse products"><svg width="23" height="23" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 8h14l1 13H4L5 8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M9 9V6a3 3 0 0 1 6 0v3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg></a>{% endif %}</div><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__body"><h3 class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-title">{{ title | escape }}</h3><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price">{% if product != blank %}{{ product.price | money }}{% else %}{{ block.settings.price_fallback | escape }}{% endif %}</div></div></article>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrows"><button class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" type="button" data-prev aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow--next" type="button" data-next aria-label="Next">›</button></div></div></plant-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
<script>(function(){const n='plant-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }}';if(customElements.get(n))return;class PlantSlider extends HTMLElement{connectedCallback(){this.t=this.querySelector('[data-track]');this.querySelector('[data-prev]').addEventListener('click',()=>this.move(-1));this.querySelector('[data-next]').addEventListener('click',()=>this.move(1))}move(d){const c=this.t.querySelector('article');if(c)this.t.scrollBy({left:d*(c.getBoundingClientRect().width+18),behavior:'smooth'})}}customElements.define(n,PlantSlider)})();</script>
{% schema %}{"name":"Plant carousel with links","settings":[{"type":"text","id":"heading","label":"Heading","default":"Plants to love"},{"type":"url","id":"view_all_link","label":"View all products link"},{"type":"text","id":"view_all_label","label":"View all button label","default":"View all products"},{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},{"type":"text","id":"price_fallback","label":"Fallback price","default":"View product"},{"type":"header","content":"Plant 1"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"image_1","label":"Plant image"},{"type":"text","id":"title_1","label":"Title","default":"Plant one"},{"type":"product","id":"product_1","label":"Shopify product"},{"type":"header","content":"Plant 2"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"image_2","label":"Plant image"},{"type":"text","id":"title_2","label":"Title","default":"Plant two"},{"type":"product","id":"product_2","label":"Shopify product"},{"type":"header","content":"Plant 3"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"image_3","label":"Plant image"},{"type":"text","id":"title_3","label":"Title","default":"Plant three"},{"type":"product","id":"product_3","label":"Shopify product"},{"type":"header","content":"Plant 4"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"image_4","label":"Plant image"},{"type":"text","id":"title_4","label":"Title","default":"Plant four"},{"type":"product","id":"product_4","label":"Shopify product"},{"type":"header","content":"Plant 5"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"image_5","label":"Plant image"},{"type":"text","id":"title_5","label":"Title","default":"Plant five"},{"type":"product","id":"product_5","label":"Shopify product"},{"type":"header","content":"Plant 6"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"image_6","label":"Plant image"},{"type":"text","id":"title_6","label":"Title","default":"Plant six"},{"type":"product","id":"product_6","label":"Shopify product"}],"presets":[{"name":"Plant carousel with links"}],"tag":null,"class":"plant-carousel-links"}{% endschema %}